&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote (EU based, GMT timezone)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Contract (B2B)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract Length:&lt;/strong&gt; 3 months (with potential for extension)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About YLD:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to help our clients keep moving forward. We work with them to build the skills and capabilities they need to stay ahead of the competition, and we know our success only happens when they succeed. We’re a team of curious, talented people, and we’re committed to making YLD a place where great people want to work, grow, and stay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a remote-first consultancy specialising in software engineering, product design, and data. Our teams are based across London, Lisbon, and Porto, and we create digital solutions that continue to deliver value long after our work is done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the role:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Platform Software Engineer at YLD, you&#39;ll be part of a client team, owning cloud access and identity management along with a large part of their infrastructure-as-code. Day to day, that means controlling who and what can do what across their cloud estate, and standing up the newer tooling that sits alongside it. It&#39;s shared infrastructure that many teams depend on, so much of the role is careful change management, governance, and unblocking others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Skills:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, hands-on AWS experience, particularly IAM, IAM Identity Center / SSO, and AWS Organizations (essential)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running shared, high-blast-radius infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GitHub Actions for CI/CD, including OIDC federation to cloud providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Datadog, CloudWatch, or similar tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some Python or JavaScript for scripting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-cloud experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong focus on clean engineering practices, including testing and reliability;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools to augment your work, applying sound judgement to adopt emerging technologies where they genuinely add value and increase your impact as an engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to work with a forward-thinking, ethical, and fun group of people and to develop and grow your skills in a fast-moving business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our typical recruitment process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1st Interview with a Talent Partner (30/45 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Interview with our Senior Developers (1h30)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final chat with our Client Partner (30/45 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/yld.io/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get a glimpse of what it&#39;s like working at YLD! 🤳&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/yld/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check out our LinkedIn page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We live and breathe our values, and know you will too:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Including everyone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationships built on honesty and ethics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspiring solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Winning together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re an equal-opportunity employer and value diversity in all its forms. We do not discriminate based on race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, pregnancy or maternity, age, marital status, or disability. We also offer a remote-first working environment, with flexible working and work–life balance as standard for all employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Joblogic Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1998,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic&lt;/strong&gt; is the UK’s #1 &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Management&lt;/strong&gt; (FSM) software platform. We are a global business with offices in the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;. Since our management buy-out in 2013, we have grown from &lt;strong&gt;~£500K &lt;/strong&gt;ARR to &lt;strong&gt;~£35M+ &lt;/strong&gt;ARR and expanded our team from 11 to 500+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about_the_role_0&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fresh out of uni and wondering what&#39;s next? Joblogic is looking for ambitious graduates to join our Sales Development team in Birmingham.&lt;br&gt;No sales experience needed — just drive, curiosity, and the willingness to learn. We&#39;ll teach you the rest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what_your_main_focus_will_be_1&quot;&gt;What your main focus will be&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect with potential customers and generate new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn a proven sales process from a team that genuinely invests in your development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build the foundation for a career in sales — SDR is just the start&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what_we_offer_2&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured onboarding and ongoing coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear progression path (many of our Account Executives and Team Leads started as Graduate SDRs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive base salary + commission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supportive, high-energy team culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;our_process__3&quot;&gt;Our process:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply below&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete a short online assessment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast-track interview day at our Birmingham office — meet our CRO and SDR Manager, take part in a role play, and have lunch with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful candidates will receive an offer on the same day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Must be based in or around Birmingham or able to commute to our office 3 days a week. No sponsorship available — Must have full right to work in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;remuneration_package_and_benefits_4&quot;&gt;Remuneration package and benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Joblogic, we care about helping you do your best work and grow along the way. Here’s what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free parking onsite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days plus bank holiday annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension 5% and many more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
